  "id": 350000160,
  "name": "Phantom: Sentry Construct",
  "desc": "A precise and powerful battle machine that has been refitted with special technology. It carries out its master's commands with absolute loyalty.",
  "desc_open": "This enemy has a <color=HighlightB>higher RES</color> to <color=Ice>Glacio DMG</color>.\n\nA precise and powerful battle machine that has been refitted with special technology. It carries out its master's commands with absolute loyalty.\n\nAny trace of its original form has faded, leaving only finely honed combat instincts within its frequencies. As an unyielding guardian, it adapts seamlessly to all types of combat. When needed, it activates a unique component to enhance mobility or unleashes all its energy in a devastating blast.\n\nThe Montelli Family, voyaging from distant shores, has seen a wider world—and they are willing to pay any price to gain the strength needed to revive their homeland.",
